# synstudio effect
name    softfocus
label   Soft focus
group   Blur
about   A blurred copy laid back over the sharp one — glamour, not defocus
param   amount  0.5  0  1   Amount
param   radius  12   1  60  Radius
filter  [$in]split[s0][s1];[s1]gblur=sigma=$radius[s2];
filter  [s0][s2]blend=all_mode=softlight:all_opacity=$amount[$out]
